Subject: [PATCH 12/30] KitKat UI P17: Button.Colored re-parent + P16/P13
 status updates

Widget.DeviceDefault.Button.Colored re-parented from
Widget.Material.Button.Colored to Widget.DeviceDefault.Button (P17.1);
residual-Material styles documented in-file (Notification remote-view
contracts, Toolbar did not exist in 4.4, Lollipop-era typography).
TASKS.md: fourth-batch implementation notes, 13.4 closure (key text
size attrs root cause), Tier 1 Calculator/SoundRecorder closure.
